0..76 Comment "// A bridge whose introduction the bridge fold refuses, one refusal an item."
77..79 Comment "//"
80..153 Comment "// A bridge relates its endpoints and never identifies them. So it has no"
154..230 Comment "// reflexivity, and a fibre the fold reads empty has no inhabitant. A sealed"
231..307 Comment "// type hides its representation, and a code outside the fold has no clause."
308..310 Comment "//"
311..386 Comment "// Each item writes an introduction at a bridge. The fold reads the carrier"
387..463 Comment "// and the endpoints, and the checker refuses the introduction by name where"
464..503 Comment "// the fold gives no fibre it inhabits."
504..506 Comment "//"
507..571 Comment "// - see: `model/identity/bridge.gandr` — the bridges admitted"
572..618 Comment "// - see: #3519 — the model laws of the fold"
